  "name": "Physical oceanography of the Strait of Juan de Fuca, 1998-present",
  "description": "Physical oceanographic observations used to construct models of circulation in the Strait of Juan de Fuca.\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: Constructing a model of circulation in the Strait of Juan de Fuca.\n\nSupplemental information: Risk Justification: Data are in electronic format, well backed up and well documented. Risk of Loss: Low Impact Justification: Does not affect a wide variety of users. Impact of Loss: Low Recommended Action: None",
